msgid "Kaupang Review Images"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: kaupang-review-images.php
msgid "https://github.com/nytafar/kaupang-review-images"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: kaupang-review-images.php
msgid "Review image and avatar uploads for WooCommerce product reviews — customers attach a product photo and a profile picture to their review, stored as ordinary media attachments; conditional Gravatar loading keeps default avatars off the page. Part of the Kaupang suite."
msgstr "Bilde- og avataropplasting for produktomtaler i WooCommerce – kundene legger ved et produktbilde og et profilbilde i omtalen sin, lagret som vanlige mediefiler. Betinget Gravatar-lasting holder standardavatarer borte fra siden. Del av Kaupang-pakken."

#. Author of the plugin
#: kaupang-review-images.php
msgid "Lasse Jellum"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: kaupang-review-images.php
msgid "https://jellum.net"
msgstr ""

